    {
      "id": "sol.amc-8-2002-p5.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "The days of the week cycle every \\(7\\) days. After \\(700\\) days, the day of the week will still be Saturday.\n\nAfter \\(6\\) more days, the day of the week will be Friday.\n\nThus, C is the correct answer.",
      "hints": [
        "Reduce \\(706\\) modulo \\(7.\\)",
        "\\(700\\) days is an exact number of weeks."
